title: Proposition 37
---
order: 37
---
short_label: XI.37
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If four straight lines are proportional, then parallelepipedal solids on them which are similar and similarly described are also proportional; and, if the parallelepipedal solids on them which are similar and similarly described are proportional, then the straight lines themselves are also proportional.
----
proof:

Let {AB}, {CD}, {EF}, and {GH} be four straight lines in proportion, so that {AB} is to {CD} as {EF} is to {GH}, and let there be described on {AB}, {CD}, {EF}, and {GH} the similar and similarly situated parallelepipedal solids {KA|sKA}, {LC|sLC}, {ME|sME}, {NG|sNG}.

I say that {KA|sKA} is to {LC|sLC} as {ME|sME} is to {NG|sNG}.

